WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.400
Stivea Vet. Post-operative follow-up for your patients, on WhatsApp.

00:04.400 --> 00:10.600
The pet goes home. The questions end up at the front desk.

00:10.600 --> 00:21.200
Numa, an AI assistant, checks in on your behalf over WhatsApp. [Soft message sounds.]

00:21.200 --> 00:29.400
Your team is alerted right away. Alerts are sorted by rules written with your vets. The vet always decides.

00:29.400 --> 00:37.400
All your follow-ups at a glance.

00:37.400 --> 00:46.200
Stive prepares. You confirm. Daily briefing, case summary, free slots, message drafts: nothing is sent without your click.

00:46.200 --> 00:51.400
Serious about data, simple every day.

00:51.400 --> 00:58.000
Numa and Stive, your AI assistants. Your patients followed up. Your team relieved.
